{
  "id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44",
  "card_id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "44",
  "title": "二次方程的根的公式",
  "printed_title": "44. 二次方程的根的公式",
  "start_page": 258,
  "start_printed": 252,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 15,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们学习了用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程. 但是这种方法需要作烦琐的变形. 因此，先求出一般形式的二次方程的解，引出根的公式，今后再按照这个公式解二次方程就比较方便.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了求解方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，　其中 $a\\neq0$，　（1）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们用 $a$ 除它所有的项，得到和它同解的方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$.　（2）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 252,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0258#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配出二项式的平方：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（2）具有下列形式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$.　（3）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（3）的根的个数，也就是方程（1）的根的个数决定于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的符号. 因为 $a\\neq0$，所以当 $a$ 是任何数时，分式的分母是正的，于是，分式的符号由它的分子的符号确定.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们用字母 $D$ 表示式 $b^2-4ac$，并且把方程（3）写成",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1）设 $D<0$. 那么分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是负的，而当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是正的. 于是，在这种情况下，方程（3）没有根，也就是和它同解的方程（1）没有根.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2）设 $D=0$. 那么方程（3）具有下列形式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所得到的方程，也就是和它同解的方程（1）有唯一的根$-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 253,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0259#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 设 $D>0$. 我们把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$. 那么方程（1）就和下列方程同解：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "就是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此得：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$　或　$x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "就是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　或　$x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程（1）有两个根：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "可采用下面的简便写法：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，其中　$D=b^2-4ac$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们把它叫做二次方程的根的公式.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们看到，二次方程的根是不是存在以及根的个数决定于表示式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值. 这个表示式叫做二次方程的判别式.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们已经知道，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；当 $D=0$ 时，它有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 254,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0260#15",
        "p0261#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们发现，二次方程的根的公式可以用于 $D=0$ 的情形.实际上，当 $D=0$ 时，公式具有下面的形式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此得　　$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，二次方程的根的公式适用于任何有根的二次方程.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来看利用上面推出的公式求解二次方程的例子.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1　解方程　$12x^2+7x+1=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在这个方程里，$a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求出判别式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为判别式是正的，那么方程有两个根，这两个根可以利用二次方程的根的公式求出：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此得",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，　$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 255,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0261#15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2　解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，所以",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程有唯一根：　$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3　解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这里 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "判别式 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$. 因为判别式是负的，所以方程没有根.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 这种形式的方程里，系数 $b$ 或 $c$当中即使有一个等于零，也可以根据二次方程的根的公式求解. 系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个等于零的方程叫做不完全的二次方程.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全的二次方程. 在第一个方程里，$a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$，在第二个方程里，$a=1$，$b=0$，$c=1.21$，在第三个方程里，$a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下面我们利用所推出的公式解不完全的二次方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们发现，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这种形式的不完全的二次方程时，正象我们在前面做过的一样，利用把方程左边分解因式的方法更方便.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 256,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0262#15",
        "p0263#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "举例说，对于方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，等于 0.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "解二次方程时，有时利用写成另一种形式的根的公式比较方便.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母除以 2 并且把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移到根号下面. 得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为 $D=b^2-4ac$，所以 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "二次方程的求根公式可以写成下面的形式，就是：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，其中　$\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "写成这种形式的公式，可以用来解判别式不是负值的任何二次方程（显然，如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）. 实际上，在 $b$ 是偶数（也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "举例说，假设需要解方程",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 257,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0263#13"
      ]
